  "Grid"]], "Output",ExpressionUUID->"16c789ed-dd24-4df9-b19d-3f51b7823237"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Answer. ",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontColor->RGBColor[
   0.1803921568627451, 0.49019607843137253`, 0.42745098039215684`]],
 "This notebook computes and visualizes exact expressions already present in \
the local development. Lean remains the proof authority, and the paper \
remains the source of the public-facing interpretive narrative."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"38db9ae4-1b1c-4c07-8cd0-dfdeab5024b8"]
